OL,3,GNEWSA'Light at the end of the tunnel'  
OL,4,Aor 'halfway there' - NI businesses on  
OL,5,Anew Brexit deal                        
OL,7,FBusinesses in Northern Ireland have    
OL,8,Fbroadly welcomed a new UK-EU trade deal
OL,9,Fthat aims to make it easier to bring in
OL,10,Fgoods from Great Britain.              
OL,12,FThe agreement, reached in Brussels on  
OL,13,FFriday, will remove routine checks and 
OL,14,Fhealth certificates for most food and  
OL,15,Fplants moving across the Irish Sea.    
OL,17,FRetailers and wholesalers said the     
OL,18,Fchanges could cut costs, speed up      
OL,19,Fdeliveries and make it easier to source
OL,20,Fproducts from suppliers in Great       
OL,21,FBritain.                               
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
