OL,3,GNEWSA'Light at the end of the tunnel'  
OL,4,Aor 'halfway there' - NI businesses on  
OL,5,Anew Brexit deal                        
OL,7,FRetail NI, which represents independent
OL,8,Fretailers and wholesalers, said the    
OL,9,Fdeal could cut paperwork, costs and    
OL,10,Fdelays for businesses bringing in goods
OL,11,Ffrom Great Britain.                    
